title: Remove deprecated StorageIterator and StorageKeyIterator
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    # Description

    Removes deprecated `migration::StorageIterator` and `migration::StorageKeyIterator` as part of #11561.

    Deprecated in July 2023. Use `storage_iter` / `storage_iter_with_suffix` and `storage_key_iter` / `storage_key_iter_with_suffix` instead. No remaining in-repo usage.

    Does not close #11561.

    ## Integration

    ```diff
    - StorageIterator::<T>::new(module, item)
    + storage_iter::<T>(module, item)

    - StorageKeyIterator::<K, T, H>::new(module, item)
    + storage_key_iter::<K, T, H>(module, item)
    ```
    Review Notes

    - Single file: substrate/frame/support/src/storage/migration.rs
    - Replacement free functions already exist and are used in-tree
crates:
- name: frame-support
  bump: major
